== General Overview ==

Accessories are are items which are usually slotted. Most are not sold by [[NPC]]s. Accessories usually give little to no [[DEF]]. Accessories ''cannot'' be upgraded.

:''For a list of accessory recommendations, please check the [[Equipment#Accessories|Equipment Accessories section]].''

