'''Kunai''' are a type of [[ammunition]] used for the skill [[Throw Kunai]]. Only [[Ninja]]s can make Kunai through an [[NPC]] at the Ninja Guild in [[Amatsu]] or [[Prontera]]. They are made in sets of 10 each.

*{{item |id=13292 Dried Squid}} and {{item |id=13293* Flying Fish}} can be purchased at Malangdo Island from Roving Merchant <malangdo 150,135> for a cost of 200 Malang Sp Can, each box contains 200 items.

*It's important to notice that you can use a [[Merchant]] with [[Discount]] to buy the requirements to manufacture the Kunai, that practice could be in handy to [[Making_Zeny#Conserving_Zeny | Conserving Zeny]].

*Similar to [[Arrows#Quiver|Arrow Quiver]], each '''Scroll/Summon Scroll''' contain 500 pieces of Kunai. Scroll can be traded to the Ninja Tool Merchant inside the Weapon/Armor Dealer in any town or city.

